sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant GoHTTP as Go Feature Server<br/>HTTP /get-online-features
    participant GoGRPC as Go Feature Server<br/>gRPC ServingService
    participant PyHTTP as Python Feature Server<br/>FastAPI :6566/TCP
    participant Registry as Registry Server<br/>gRPC RegistryServer
    participant Offline as Offline Server<br/>Arrow Flight
    participant OnlineStore as Online Store<br/>(PostgreSQL / Redis)
    participant RegistryBackend as Registry Backend<br/>(S3 / GCS / DB)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>:6443/HTTPS
    participant Operator as Feast Operator<br/>(Reconciler)

    Note over Client,OnlineStore: Flow 1: Online Feature Retrieval (Go HTTP)
    Client->>Route: POST /get-online-features<br/>HTTPS/443
    Route->>GoHTTP: Forward request<br/>HTTP
    GoHTTP->>OnlineStore: Read features<br/>(pgx pool / go-redis)
    OnlineStore-->>GoHTTP: Feature vectors
    GoHTTP-->>Route: JSON response
    Route-->>Client: Feature response

    Note over Client,OnlineStore: Flow 2: Online Feature Retrieval (gRPC)
    Client->>GoGRPC: GetOnlineFeatures RPC<br/>gRPC/HTTP2
    GoGRPC->>OnlineStore: Read features<br/>(pgx pool / go-redis)
    OnlineStore-->>GoGRPC: Feature vectors
    GoGRPC-->>Client: Protobuf response

    Note over Client,OnlineStore: Flow 3: Online Feature Retrieval (Python)
    Client->>PyHTTP: POST /get-online-features<br/>HTTP :6566
    PyHTTP->>OnlineStore: Read features
    OnlineStore-->>PyHTTP: Feature vectors
    PyHTTP-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over Client,RegistryBackend: Flow 4: Registry Management
    Client->>Registry: CRUD RPCs<br/>(ApplyEntity, ListFeatureViews, ...)
    Registry->>RegistryBackend: Read/write metadata<br/>(S3/GCS/DB)
    RegistryBackend-->>Registry: Registry state
    Registry-->>Client: Registry response

    Note over Client,Offline: Flow 5: Offline Feature Retrieval
    Client->>Offline: Arrow Flight DoGet<br/>gRPC streaming
    Note over Offline: FIPS: detects /proc/sys/crypto/fips_enabled<br/>Sets GRPC_SSL_CIPHER_SUITES<br/>before pyarrow.flight import
    Offline-->>Client: Columnar data stream<br/>(Arrow RecordBatch)

    Note over Operator,K8sAPI: Flow 6: Operator Reconciliation
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Watch FeatureStore CRs<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: FeatureStore events
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployments,<br/>Services, ConfigMaps, RBAC,<br/>HPA, PDB, CronJobs, Routes
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Resource status
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Update FeatureStore status
